# FORCED arms (no shipped CHOG): two ChozoGhosts spawned in 08_sand_casualpirates with a borrowed
# SpacePirate body (ANCS of u04d0, character 1), AFSM 5652a12f and pirate WPSC 681f3907.  Each state body runs from
# statecall (Activate, an Update every frame so the body controller moves on, Deactivate), then
# triggers (trigcall), script messages (send), user anim events (uevent), the visors (PreRender),
# touch, shots (shoot charged: KnockBack/Hurled) and kills.  The second ghost has fadeOutDelay 0,
# startStyle 3 (the crouched InActive), flags 3 and near/mid distances 0.5/1 (the far chances).
# Needs the knockbackRules write: run with tools/cov/specs/chozoghost_force.py (see its header),
# paced (no --fast: the `frame` breaks hold the console queue under 256 commands), --frames 1000.
@f300 god 1; give missile 50; give chargeBeam 1
@f330 spawn CHOG inactive ancs u04d0 1 34 fsm 5652a12f prop 54151870 0x681f3907 prop 3a58089c 0x681f3907
@f332 spawn CHOG ancs u04d0 1 34 fsm 5652a12f prop 54151870 0x681f3907 prop 3a58089c 0x681f3907 prop fb12f672 0.0 prop ec76940c 3 prop fe9eac26 3 prop 61e511b3 0.5 prop 2369607a 1.0
@f334 spawn CHOG
@f340 send e0036ff00 Activate; objs chozoghost
@f342 place e0036ff00 player 6; place e0036ff01 player 30
